        {
            "+content": "Uichi is a once-popular student who is now relentlessly bullied in high school. Still, he strives every day to keep a promise to Yotsuha (his first love from elementary school before she transferred schools) to become a veterinarian. Just as he reaches his limit with the bullying, Yotsuha suddenly appears before him. She has seemingly not changed since back then — except she harbors only one hidden resolve deep in her eyes. <em class=de-emphasized>(from manga)</em>",
